<x:xmpmeta xmlns:x="adobe:ns:meta/">
  <rdf:RDF xmlns:rdf="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#">
    <rdf:Description xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/" rdf:about="">
      <dc:title>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">She-Ra: Champion of Power</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Alt>
      </dc:title>
      <dc:description>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">&lt;p&gt;You all know the twist. Two Horde cadets, one recently made a Force Captain, the other destined to be left behind, â€œborrowâ€ a skiff and go for a joyride. Instead of Adora, Catra is the one who falls, the one who finds the Sword, the one burdened with a destiny meant for another.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;This is not that story.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;When Catra reached her sixteenth birthday (not that the Horde tells her what that is), Shadow Weaver takes Catraâ€™s first life. What happens next changes the fate of Etheria...&lt;/p&gt;</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Alt>
      </dc:description>
      <dc:creator>
        <rdf:Seq>
          <rdf:li>Firebird_X</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Seq>
      </dc:creator>
